title: Route1DinnerDoor
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_dinner_notes = "">>
<<declare $r1_dinner_reply = "">>
<<declare $r1_dishes_turn = "">>
// Started by knocking on 3A on Thursday evening (door_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<wait 1>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Eight o'clock. You're learning.
<<if $r1_croissant_dinner == "bring">>
    {$samantha_name}: And the right bottle. Give it here.
<<elseif $r1_croissant_dinner == "busy">>
    {$samantha_name}: Not busy after all, then.
    You: My plans fell through.
    {$samantha_name}: You didn't have plans.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Empty-handed. I bought wine anyway. You owe me.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Come in. You know the rule.
You: Shoes off.
{$samantha_name}: Good.
<<if $r1_croissant_socks == "yes">>
    {$samantha_name}: Blush again. You're making a habit of it.
<<elseif $r1_croissant_socks == "wash">>
    {$samantha_name}: Out of the wash, I see. Finally.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Still not wearing them. I noticed. I notice everything.
<<endif>>
// She goes back to her stove; he follows her in.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToKitchen3A no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3A>>
<<await_walks>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Five minutes. Look around if you want.
{$samantha_name}: Don't touch the knives. Sit down when you're ready.
// The player now walks around her flat. Sitting at the table starts Route1Dinner (table_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Dinner
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by sitting down at her table (table_3a.yarn).
<<place Player PlayerSit>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaSit>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Pasta. Don't look so surprised.
You: It smells great.
{$samantha_name}: I know.
{$samantha_name}: I study people, you know. It's practically my job.
{$samantha_name}: After the viewing I wrote down a few lines about you. I do it with everyone who sees the flat.
{$samantha_name}: Want to hear them?
-> Yes.
    <<set $r1_dinner_notes to "yes">>
    {$samantha_name}: Of course you do.
-> You wrote about me?
    <<set $r1_dinner_notes to "surprised">>
    {$samantha_name}: Three lines. Don't flatter yourself.
-> No.
    <<set $r1_dinner_notes to "no">>
    {$samantha_name}: I'll tell you anyway. That's the other thing about me.
{$samantha_name}: "Keen to please. Waits to be told. Doesn't know it yet."
-> That's not true.
    <<set $r1_dinner_reply to "deny">>
    {$samantha_name}: You knocked at five past six because I said tomorrow.
    {$samantha_name}: You took your shoes off tonight before I'd finished the sentence.
    You: That's just manners.
    {$samantha_name}: Mm. Eat your pasta.
-> ...Maybe.
    <<set $r1_dinner_reply to "maybe">>
    {$samantha_name}: Maybe. That's the most honest thing you've said all week.
-> Is that a bad thing?
    <<set $r1_dinner_reply to "ask">>
    {$samantha_name}: Not to me.
    {$samantha_name}: It might turn out to be very good. We'll see.
{$samantha_name}: Anyway. I cooked, so you wash up.
You: Is that a rule too?
{$samantha_name}: It is now. The sink's over there. Take your time. I like to watch.
// The player walks to the sink himself. Using it starts Route1Dishes (sink_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Dishes
tags: cutscene
---
// Started at her sink after dinner (sink_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerAtSink>>
<<face Player up>>
<<wait 2>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaBehindSink>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
{$samantha_name}: You missed a spot.
You: Where?
{$samantha_name}: Don't turn around. Keep washing.
-> Okay.
    <<set $r1_dishes_turn to "stay">>
    {$samantha_name}: See? Easy.
-> Why?
    <<set $r1_dishes_turn to "why">>
    {$samantha_name}: Because I said so. That's usually enough for you.
-> Turn around anyway.
    <<set $r1_dishes_turn to "turned">>
    <<face Player Samantha>>
    {$samantha_name}: Hm. There he is.
    {$samantha_name}: Back to the plates.
    <<face Player up>>
<<wait 2>>
{$samantha_name}: You did well tonight.
// She kisses his cheek from behind.
{$samantha_name}: That's for doing as you're told.
{$samantha_name}: Next Thursday. Same time. I'll text you what to bring.
You: And if I'm busy?
{$samantha_name}: You won't be.
// She sees him out.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToDoor3AInside>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<walk Player PlayerOutOf3A>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Goodnight, neighbour.
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<wait 1>>
// Time skip to the next Thursday, after work (route1_thursday2.yarn). He comes up the
// stairs; her text is waiting. When this node ends the player walks freely.
<<next_scene Route1Thu2Start>>
===
